g(y)
=\lim_{\epsilon\downarrow 0}\Bover1{(\sqrt{2\pi})^r}
  \int_{\Bbb R^r}
  e^{-iy\dotproduct x}e^{-\epsilon x\dotproduct x}f(x)dx
